  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"1310\">\n<li data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"881\">\n<p data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"881\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Detects <strong data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"751\">germline mutations</strong> in DNA mismatch repair (MMR) genes associated with <strong data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"821\">Lynch Syndrome</strong>, the most common cause of <strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"880\">hereditary colorectal cancer</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"1020\">\n<p data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"1020\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Positive result indicates <strong data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"937\">increased lifetime risk</strong> for colorectal, endometrial, ovarian, gastric, and other Lynch-associated cancers.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1200\">\n<p data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1034\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Useful for:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1200\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1125\">\n<p data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1125\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Individuals with family history of early-onset or multiple colorectal/related cancers.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1200\">\n<p data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1200\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Genetic counseling and targeted cancer surveillance in family members.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1310\">\n<p data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1310\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Follow-up testing for <strong data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1264\">mutation-specific cascade screening</strong> in relatives is advised if mutation is found.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
